WEBVTT

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.800
Legendary warriors...

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:26.840
You're the only thing that 
hampers my eternal life.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:33.470
It was supposed to be a simple thing to

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.610
take the Power of Creation 
from the Field of Light...

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:39.180
Until you appeared.

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:46.750
For the future of darkness, I must 
bury the legendary warriors forever.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.330
He was after Pretty Cure...

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:56.530
That's why he came here mipo.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:57.810
That can't be!

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:00.470
No way!

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.010
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:06.680
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:09.450
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:13.920
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:16.620
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.760
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:21.360
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.360
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.170
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:32.970
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot,</i>

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:34.940
<i>we both</i>

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:36.270
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:38.840
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.850
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:45.420
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.590
<i>Don't you know that good fortune</i>

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:51.160
<i>comes to the gates of laughter?
Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:57.330
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:57.730 --> 00:01:58.630
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:01.100
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:04.140
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:08.410
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are</i>

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.480
<i>Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:15.210
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:21.290
What happened?

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:34.330
Pretty Cure!

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:38.000
Legendary warriors, Pretty Cure!

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:15.880
What power!

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:20.550
What happened?

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:22.840
What did he do?

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:26.480
Where are the people?

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:32.460
Where did everyone go?

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.660
What did you do?

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.390
Don't tell me, you...!

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:41.390
All I did was prepare the stage just for us.

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:45.320
If you want everything to go back to the 
way it was, you'll have to defeat me.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.620
That's only if you can.

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:53.050
Jyaku-King...!

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:54.230
This is unforgivable!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.880
We absolutely refuse to...

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.420
...let you do this!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:05.790
"BELIEVE IN THE FUTURE! BELIEVE IN 
TOMORROW! WE WON'T LET YOU SAY GOODBYE!!"

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.790
Ready, White? One more time!

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.000
With all of our power!

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:16.210
Help us, Pollun!

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:18.280
Please! You can do it, can't you?

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:20.370
You'll do it, won't you? Please...

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.310
Pollun!

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:26.200
Po...?

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:29.410
I can do it popo!

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.520
I'll try popo!

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:35.480
I can do it popo!

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:50.840
Pretty Cula... Do your best popo!

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:05.380
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.570
And fight your way toward the future!

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:12.310
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.800
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:51.460
Your mere existence can't 
even compare to mine.

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.880
We're just...

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:02.430
...getting started.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:07.680
Queen! The light is starting to 
disappear from the Field of Light!

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:12.010
After swallowing the Power 
of Creation, Jyaku-King's

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.860
power has grown even stronger.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:18.370
I can no longer restrain 
it with my own power.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:21.090
At this rate, the world will be 
in darkness for all eternity.

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:23.880
Queen! Please hang on!

00:06:24.390 --> 00:06:25.500
Pretty Cure...!

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:46.930
Isn't there something that 
can defeat total darkness?

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:51.800
I pity you two...

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:57.560
If you hadn't become legendary warriors, 
you wouldn't have to go through this.

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:00.080
Don't be ridiculous!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:03.500
I'm grateful that I became 
Pretty Cure because

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:07.260
I'll be able to beat you 
with my own two hands.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:11.380
We absolutely refuse to 
give up until the very end.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:13.620
You fools!

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:23.760
Pretty Cula...

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:25.360
It's no use...

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:42.920
Queen!

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:43.660
Pollun...?

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.380
Pollun, you...

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.800
I want to help Pretty Cula popo...

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:54.180
Tell me what I can do to save them popo!

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:55.290
Pollun...

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.960
Pretty Cula used to scold 
me all the time popo...

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:00.760
We used to fight all the time, too popo...

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.990
But we laughed together too, popo...

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.820
I love Pretty Cula very much popo!

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:11.670
So I want you to tell me what I can do popo.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:17.140
Something is about to awaken inside you...

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:18.180
Popo?

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:21.080
It's what's been sleeping 
inside you until now...

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.310
It's your own power.

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:25.920
You realize it now, don't you?

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:29.180
What you have to do now.

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:31.320
Don't worry...

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:34.910
If you truly listen to the feelings 
of love you have for Pretty Cure,

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:38.830
your power will open the way to the future.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.460
You've grown, haven't you, Pollun?

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:47.180
I can see that we can rely on you now.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.510
Believe in your own power...

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.980
Now, go back to your beloved Pretty Cure.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.450
Yes popo.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:59.430
I can't believe he's the 
same unmanageable child.

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:01.320
We're counting on you, Pollun.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:21.340
Farewell, legendary warriors, Pretty Cure!

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:43.530
Farewell, legendary warriors, Pretty Cure!

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:45.230
No popo!

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:49.350
Pollun?

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.290
It's dangerous.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:53.520
You mustn't pick on Pretty Cula popo!

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:55.240
I won't allow it popo!

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:58.240
What do you think you can do?

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:05.180
I love Pretty Cula, so I'm 
going to do my best popo!

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:08.390
No matter what you do it's useless!

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:10.090
Pollun!

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:18.960
What the...? The power of 
darkness has been neutralized!

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:23.780
I'm going to do my best popo!

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:29.590
I'm going to do my best popo!

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:49.260
Popo!!

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:04.320
The power of the rainbow bracelets...

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:05.440
...is back to the way it was!

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:08.170
It's shining so brightly mipo!

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:11.970
The power of light didn't just come 
together to bring the bracelets back,

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:14.150
but it's made it even more powerful mepo!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.640
Pretty Cula do your best...

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:18.450
Popo...

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.550
Pollun!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.470
Thank you, Pollun.

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.340
You saved us again, didn't you?

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.210
We won't let your efforts go to waste.

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:41.680
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:45.050
And fight your way toward the future!

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:48.420
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:06.790
I told you it was useless, didn't I?

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:10.910
Your power has no effect on me.

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:13.870
I'll admit that your presence is strong...

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:16.010
We couldn't possibly match it,

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:18.920
but we won't lose!

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.080
We just can't lose!

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:25.020
We have something precious, 
and people we care about.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.430
Mipple and Mepple... and Pollun.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:32.450
And the lives that support us

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:34.970
and all the lives that are connected to me.

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:36.100
That's why...

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.400
We...

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.900
...absolutely refuse to be defeated.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.680
This is the greatest power...

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:47.280
The Power of Annihilation!

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:55.890
It's absolutely impossible 
for you to defeat me.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:58.170
Even if we know it's impossible...

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:01.960
We have to try!

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.240
Why?

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.130
In order to protect this world...

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.140
We have to do our best.

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:20.980
We just have to!

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:31.090
Do you think you can...

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.940
Queen!

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:41.240
Is this the power that you entrusted to them?

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:44.370
Is this the last of your power?

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:51.440
Queen! I won't forget this!

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:06.190
What happened?

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:09.320
Mom! Let's go!

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:26.320
I may have given up...

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:29.500
I thought they couldn't possibly do it,

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:30.840
but...

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:36.480
Nagisa-san.... Honoka-san...

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:41.790
You believed in everyone's 
power, and your own feelings.

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.630
Thank you. I finally understand...

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:47.520
Where I belong,

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:49.920
and where I want to be...

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.720
It's over, isn't it?

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:14.690
It's over.

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:17.900
Does that mean we've 
graduated from Pretty Cure?

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.940
Isn't Pollun awake yet?

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:26.550
He's been asleep all this time.

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:28.770
Good work...

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:32.560
You both really did your 
best until now, didn't you?

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.450
And you'll have to do your 
best from now on, too.

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:40.140
Your second year is over,

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:42.230
and you'll soon be in your 
third year, won't you?

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:43.550
So do your best.

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.660
As the senior students at Verone Academy.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:49.040
Is that what you meant?

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:50.630
We'll do our best.

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:55.590
Shall we eat, Chutaro?

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:04.130
Nagisa... Honoka...

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:05.240
What is it?

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:08.210
We're going to rest, too mipo.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:10.220
Rest?

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.870
Without Jyaku-King, the Field of Light

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:17.920
and the Field of Rainbows 
is at peace now mepo.

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.240
Just because we're at peace...

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:21.630
What's this about resting?

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:25.330
That's the end of our duty mipo.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:28.030
Over...? It can't be...

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.690
We owe it all to the two of you mepo.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.810
The two of you saved us mepo.

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:36.590
How can you say we saved you...?

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:41.280
We learned a lot from you, 
and you saved us, too.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:42.750
That's right!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:46.610
That's why we decided mipo...

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:49.780
That we won't go back to 
the Field of Light, and

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:53.980
stay with you two forever...

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:55.230
Mipple!

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:56.720
That's right mepo.

00:16:57.480 --> 00:17:02.170
Mipple and I will sleep forever 
here on the Field of Rainbows,

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:05.940
but we'll always be with you mepo.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.910
That's right mipo...

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:10.310
You can't...!

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:14.780
Nagisa... thank you for all 
you've done until now mepo.

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:18.720
Honoka... good night mipo!

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:27.360
No! Don't leave me!

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:32.330
No! No! No! Mepple!

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:00.930
What is it?

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:07.130
You've both been blessed with 
the powers of Pretty Cure mepo.

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:08.430
Pretty Cure?

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:11.830
From now, you're going 
to fight alongside us as

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:13.910
the Protectors of Light mipo.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:17.380
Fight? You have no right 
to decide that for us.

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:19.740
You'll take care of us, too mepo.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.520
We're counting on you mipo!

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:49.910
Shiho!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:51.710
Rina!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.540
You're late, Nagisa!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:54.680
I'm sorry!

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:57.050
You're always oversleeping.

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:59.680
Nagisa's even enticed Yukishiro-san.

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:01.390
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:03.150
Yukishiro-san!

00:19:03.590 --> 00:19:04.720
Yes?

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:08.290
Are you prepared to make the farewell address to 
the graduating class as the student body representative?

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:11.260
Yes, I am.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:16.590
49th Graduation Ceremony

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:23.580
Farewell address...

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:24.810
We...

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:39.490
We have learned a lot of things from 
the senior members of the school...

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:44.070
We realize how important 
it is to do normal every-

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.760
day things like going to school,

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:47.670
and laughing with our friends.

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:50.500
There were frustrating times...

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.710
Fighting and feeling discouraged...

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.180
Times that we felt like crying,

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:58.680
but each time, the seniors would 
give us encouragement and teach us,

00:19:58.680 --> 00:19:59.970
so we could overcome it.

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:04.330
We are happy to have lived 
in this town and in this

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:07.720
school together with the senior class.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:10.920
The rest of the student body will continue on

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:14.230
here at Verone Academy after 
they have left, and carry

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.630
on what they have taught us.

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:20.310
We wish all the seniors 
the best in the future.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:23.730
Congratulations on your graduation.

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:27.520
Honoka Yukishiro, second 
year student, Sakura class,

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:28.610
representing the student body.

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:52.700
Honoka?

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.820
Kiriya... kun?

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:23.330
Hey! Let's go!

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:48.410
We'll see him again, won't we?

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:52.400
We will...

00:21:54.440 --> 00:21:57.550
I'm sure we will someday under this sky...

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:25.320
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:26.860
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:29.560
<i>L-O-V-E Love Love, get you!</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.300
<i>I can't do this!</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>I'd rather be a young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:51.580
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.690
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:10.700
<i>I'm a teenager with a</i>

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>heart throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:16.670
<i>I don't want to lose that</i>

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:22.950
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>It's romance rather than stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

